❗️During the day, the Armed Forces of the Russian Federation continued launching strikes at ports and vessels used in the interests of the AFU.

As a result of the strikes, high-precision weapons and attack drones hit:

▪️at Port of Odessa, facilities of POL unloading and storage terminal intended to support the AFU;

▪️at Port of Chernomorsk, tanks with fuel and lubricants intended for the AFU;

▪️at Port of Nikolayev, a dry cargo ship delivering materiel.

🔹 Russian Defence Ministry

